      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e524aa5258e12c38d160da9e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要做哪项训练呢！？\r\n我总觉得……今天一定\r\n能够看见崭新的自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9854764b3b7eee7d5f2fbc03cf5e48fea07d6848eda885d037198da4fa6e56f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9198c9c95ec7740d5930c8f7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最近我喜欢的作家\r\n非常努力地创作新作品……\r\n我也不能输呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5323de4428b80967f9afcbf9eb388a0e06d4e2942a12247148cb305f9a7afc0d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0faa28dcf0fc0d46ca3814d3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经历的每个训练都是为故事\r\n增添色彩的小插曲……只要这样想，\r\n训练就会变得愉快了起来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59a7ddeacbfe01fb080b54e13e05396b2454067b80e90ff536a8a074339ad6e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2bf703b8d317622904cb6e5",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽、虽然没有根据……\r\n但我总觉得，今天自己一定能够\r\n展现出比平时更优秀的一面……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4aa4bdd977ebe01c31ec559ac3f3aa5aa910066985f87ae4993c9b5f96d2523",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c1559acd364c4083e61a8e6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标越高，平时的努力就越重要。\r\n为了成为英雄\r\n我一定要加油……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c8ab26b395018fc3feced29295cda91f5a16a2ec4ccef1b0f0cee6179b77c1f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:498b8607827c4429272c48d8",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要开始训练了吗？\r\n我会照着教学书籍上的\r\n内容去试看看的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92942d6ec8b5674cb22882761420454fd62e5473b6f3a5136117ed1ef9db7ecf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4465495a455605b3398399d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唉……不知道「罗布・罗伊」\r\n是否也曾像我一样，\r\n有过无法发挥实力的时候呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a02ea447b3d9c826469862a435a857c069953d226343cf603141640363663c04",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88003ff90a38283decd306ec",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "明明知道非得努力不可，\r\n但总觉得胸口好沉重……\r\n我果然……还不够成熟呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaac49411411b7ed1fa1ac3ad9554f6d7c2def424d03f7dea2226c9483cbc21c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52d55013dd55dc99bc2cb943",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我得再更积极向前才行……\r\n呜呜……我还以为读点书后\r\n就能重新打起精神了说……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8354e1abaa6232a8822923ce570dd1dc682787c3230feeaf4972f3d8e8f3a883",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c28a1b583a8c04de8e6da83e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "得努力克服的场面……\r\n要是真正的英雄，\r\n绝对不会在此停下脚步的说……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a159cc45bb6cc3c4989f82baca69601494d4735abe27922f8974844bbab0f5e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ee360724919ca15a3809821",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个……可以休息一下吗……？\r\n我在战争作品中看到，\r\n太过勉强往往会造成劣势……",
      "source_fingerprint": "caeb32e9a2bd8f82c4d14645725142c96ad8893683c38db711c7ae22615919f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b51d0d20e143896eadbb8d3c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成为英雄之路从踏出第一步做起。\r\n不过……要是连一步都走不动\r\n是不是就本末倒置了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6893a32135e1a98ebd7e9892ec1f306a1db29534c3deae6048f8b43e88835aa2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20022"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20022"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9febef1db141f6b0773b6257",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我要藉由这场比赛\r\n创造将流传于后世，\r\n属于荒漠英雄的英雄传说……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb5238eddbd8824b086405d33df2456ed666d7b5c4a4e9384b7eb6824a236bb2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20023"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20023"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d60ca4d261cb96d1be6c454",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员……我的读者，\r\n请见证我一步步\r\n变成英雄的故事……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68e85aed12ad3d7b76ae62f6d53bf3cc4dc730f3a6f8abc645b104b26039a376",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20024"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20024"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb0ddd54201c64aa4457da71",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我已经在脑中描绘出了\r\n赢得胜利的故事。\r\n接下来只要照着做就行了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb094723b7f73a9c2d10d211d5aa12b1474822eed19be3ba4f4f299f0907705b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20025"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20025"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c870ecfaef79bcd99dbc37dd",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要赢得比赛\r\n就能离憧憬更近一步。\r\n……很、很好，我要努力……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1f40e41c7984b84e3058e505fc3fd2f4fdb53976d9b72c78e73eae0210fdcf3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20026"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20026"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6412d6ef52fdc1e54f5833fc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "视野好像比平时更清晰……\r\n能清楚地看见大家的一举一动。\r\n要是能在比赛中善加利用的话……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a0d0f281a6ecfb867a8e244ec8ababbbefab9c8ce127fc00bb73aa0aeb6ca68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20027"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20027"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:030ece73c92c80ee422e5581",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然我可能……无法\r\n表现得像「罗布・罗伊」那样，\r\n但我还是会尽全力奔跑……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ffff3c9ec5441ee0d0b9d005d4d368de191604ef69dfe4eb40e5869546bf2ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20028"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20028"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55663a8898cac85b8f5eedfb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论什么状况都不能放弃，\r\n必须坚持到最后……\r\n我很希望能留下成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da0b2ad1af9cf3fe3b4678ddbaa0627ec34c6e6a0b13f55a969ff2c3aef790ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20029"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20029"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3e0daf7034af5aecc615506",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛前真是紧张……\r\n不过我觉得自己能够\r\n保持平常心发挥实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f27927217fdf0678eb5b360c4f3cb044a7e0049013c182bbe4d0c436b14ea493",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20030"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20030"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ac59d4119e61c737a68dc1b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了能在未来被称为英雄……\r\n我得不断累积战绩。\r\n训练员，我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26b30175c7b1d3c84bed1bf61ca7777dd4950e8a3e5274ff9517c555c3054c2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20031"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20031"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a2fe09a250a1f5984f2680b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然还有些许不安……\r\n但我是一路全力以赴努力过来的。\r\n我会尽其所能地去做的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37fc70f1fb84e827fae7b3ebd7b7329ea37b46c7f071f179b532a65d384ca767",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20032"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20032"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cd99fc54c25785201a50266",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只、只要读书让自己冷静下来，\r\n一定会没问题的。\r\n应、应该吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a4fb8783ef5a7879a126eecf7d671ec4a2a9cba0679e6a070d5b150b0eee043",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20033"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20033"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8bf304b8ab70e322974969f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咦？镜片起雾了……\r\n呜呜，怎么挑在比赛前起雾，\r\n害我心情变得好消沉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7224e747ae2eb16beb12b8b4ca95d4eefbf5e4780a496e91e6da205af28ccfc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20034"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20034"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcb9e2ba7a98bfd6a59fbd8e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论状况再怎么糟糕……我都会坚持\r\n跑到最后。因为我相信任何结果\r\n都有助于缔造未来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bb828bdd9d11040f1f7ead3021140f8d8cb3f5a044477b461e8a468042d22c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20035"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20035"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24531d172c511edd9a9a3312",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "竞争对手的实力是多么坚强……\r\n我不能气馁，\r\n即使对手再强还是得战斗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68a4112059a49f7a97dc53618fd34dfd1fe3c9b1357632e087bc7c326a85d1e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20036"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20036"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd5ab1efebb95746cfbd0278",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "绝不能气馁……\r\n这样会连配角都当不成的……！\r\n……我很清楚，可是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "99987329b957d17363a35307f6343f05932cfc48946c98a803e8424b36b426d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "20037"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1047/20037"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d409575b79595fd21b7a587",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我会加油的……！",
